# Mathematics

Math is typeset by **MathJax 4** with SVG output and the New Computer Modern
font. SVG output is self-contained, so no web fonts are needed at runtime.

## Inline math

The Euler identity $e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$ and the Pythagorean theorem
$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ sit inline. Other delimiters work too: \(\sqrt{2}\) and
$\tfrac{1}{2}$.

## Display math

$$
\int_{-\infty}^{\infty} e^{-x^2} \, \mathrm{d}x = \sqrt{\pi}
$$

Aligned equations:

$$
\begin{align*}
(a + b)^2 &= a^2 + 2ab + b^2 \\
(a - b)^2 &= a^2 - 2ab + b^2
\end{align*}
$$

A matrix:

$$
A = \begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \end{bmatrix}
\in \mathbb{R}^{3 \times 3}
$$

A piecewise definition:

$$
\operatorname{sgn}(x) = \begin{cases}
    -1 & \text{if } x < 0, \\
    \phantom{-}0 & \text{if } x = 0, \\
    \phantom{-}1 & \text{if } x > 0.
\end{cases}
$$

## Commutative diagrams

MathJax's `CD` environment renders commutative diagrams:

$$
\begin{CD}
A @>f>> B \\
@VgVV @VVhV \\
C @>>k> D
\end{CD}
$$
